-- Catalogue seed, generated from lib/content.ts.
--
-- Three statements, each driven by one json payload. Videos are expanded from
-- the six step templates plus a per-session list of step names, because their
-- copy is still derived from the step — the videos table gives every row its own
-- title_t and description_t, and the back office fills them in for real.
--
-- Re-running: clear the catalogue first.
--   delete from public.videos; delete from public.sessions;
--   delete from public.programs; delete from public.areas;

